  "setup_notes": "起始地点为zócalo或coyoacán(调查员任选)。探索牌堆=12张单面古代地点(6种各2张)+window_to_another_time/timeline_destabilization/a_tear_in_time/lost_in_time各1张洗混。古代地点与相同自有图标的现代地点一一对应：templo_mayor↔temple_ruins(黄圆)、temples_of_tenochtitlán↔metropolitan_cathedral(红方块)、chapultepec_hill↔chapultepec_park(蓝三角)、canals_of_tenochtitlán↔zócalo(绿菱)、lake_xochimilco↔xochimilco(橙心)、sacred_woods↔coyoacán(紫星)；古代地点入场时叠放到对应现代地点上并接替其位置，两时代连接图各自独立(connections按时代分别给出，同名a/b两版图标相同互为通道)。遭遇组按混沌袋分支：cultist≥2→加pnakotic_brotherhood+pentagram；tablet≥2→加venom+guardians_of_time；两者均<2→加pnakotic_brotherhood+guardians_of_time。"
